# Project Structure

This is a Next.js application with the following structure:

- [src/app](mdc:src/app) - Main application routes and pages using Next.js App Router
- [src/components](mdc:src/components) - Reusable UI components
- [src/lib](mdc:src/lib) - Utility functions, services, and database access
- [prisma](mdc:prisma) - Database schema and Prisma configuration
- [public](mdc:public) - Static assets

The `__deprecated__` directory contains legacy code that should not be modified.
